hi i'm ray dalio the founder of  bridgewater in a new company principles  that's meant to pass along the  principles and tools that help me  succeed  i'm excited to share with you the dot  collector to use in your zoom meetings  it's a tool that i built for myself  because i wanted to know in my meetings  what everyone was thinking not just  those who were talking  how many times are you in a meeting  wondering what are others thinking  how do i give feedback without  interrupting can we save the learning  from this meeting to use later and share  with others  while i love zoom meetings it drives me  crazy that i'm missing all of this  information  so i asked my team to build the dot  collector to use on  zoom here's how it works if you want to  give someone feedback or tell them what  you think  simply select the attribute rate it and  write them a note  they will do the same with you it's like  giving 360  degree feedback in real time all of the  dots  are automatically saved and summarized  in a grid  so it's easy to see the highlights or  drill down  into whatever anyone is thinking it even  produces  automatic summaries of the meeting for  those who want to see it later  over time this data paints rich pictures  of people and their performance  which is invaluable for helping people  and their teams improve  it's great for reviews too i urge you to  start collecting dots  zoom is now the place to do it
 

